Constellatin UI

PSEUDOCODE:
START
Create an empty map with no milestones
Set total XP to 0
REPEAT
    Display menu:
        1. Add Milestones (remaining ___)
        2. View Current Milestone and tasks
        3. Edit milestone 
        4.View Completed tasks
        5. View Total XP
        6. Exit
    Ask the user to choose an option
    IF choice is 1 THEN
        Ask for milestone name
        Ask for further information 
        IF user added TASK THEN
            Set reward to 10 XP
        ELSE IF user added INSTRUCTIONS or STEPS THEN
            Set reward to 5 XP
              END IF
        Add the milestone to milestone path list
        Display "Milestone Added"
    ELSE IF choice is 2 THEN
        Display all active tasks and milestones 
    ELSE IF choice is 3 THEN
        Display milestone path
        Ask the user which milestone to edit
        IF user changed milestone status to Completed
         THEN Add the quest reward to total XP and display "Quest     Completed"
ELSE input what user input to milestone
    ELSE IF choice is 4 THEN
        Display all completed tasks and milestones
    ELSE IF choice is 5 THEN
        Display total XP
    ELSE IF choice is 6 THEN
        Display "See you next time, friend
        END PROGRAM
    ELSE
        Display "Invalid choice"
    END IF
UNTIL the user chooses Exit
END
